[{"title":"明融 其三","author":"杨简","text":"净几横琴晚寒，梅花落在弦间。\n我欲清吟无句，转烦门外青山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72511,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙光","author":"杨简","text":"兢业初无蹊径，缉熙本有光明。\n自觉自知自信，何思何虑何营。\n镜里人情喜怒，空中云气纡萦。\n孔训于仁用力，箕畴王道平平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72512,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金明池","author":"杨简","text":"燕语莺啼，杏坛春色。\n为甚无人领略。\n又添个、山青水绿。\n是多多少少，明明白白，对面不识。\n方且荡然放逸。\n不亦文辞雕琢。\n圣人道、君子不必相与言，但示以礼乐。\n礼乐无言莫穿凿。\n一味融融，无穷静乐。\n步步行行皆妙用，言言句句俱寂寞。\n舜曰道、心明心即道，百姓日用，不知不觉。\n从学者再三，勤勤有请，也只不可说著。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72513,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"杨简","text":"山禽说我胸中事，烟柳藏他物外机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72514,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和严侍御楠木诗","author":"杨虞仲","text":"两苍崖屹相应对，上面虬龙插崖背。\n青铜为柯石为根，上有虫书篆籀破藓痕。\n诘屈盘根少态度，深锁穷山烟雨暮。\n不愿作材厄万牛，惊世之文那肯露。\n人不满百雪满头，一生忧患几许愁。\n湛辈去逐翁仲游，此树森森春复秋。\n杜陵笔墨光万丈，当时憾不同清赏。\n独寄黄花九日诗，云间声作琳琅响。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72515,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游连山涌泉观次文与可韵","author":"杨辟之","text":"双旗晓出远游山，遍览幽奇日日閒。\n幕下渊云陪后乘，马蹄归去月华间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72516,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游虎丘","author":"杨颐","text":"尽日凭高步台阁，意气飘然摆羁缚。\n灵踪绝迹万千状，群玉排青插寥廓。\n点头巨石势欲动，突立试剑峭如削。\n剑池在岭不惮浚，造化神工巧镌凿。\n寒湫耿耿浸云根，大旱烧云源不涸。\n跳珠喷激瑩无痕，百斛珠玑缀疏箔。\n丹青妙手画不到，一点尘埃无处著。\n僧居占尽佳山景，楼殿高低半丹雘。\n午斋寂寂山风幽，续断风摇四檐铎。\n始疑东海转鳌背，蓬莱弱流在西角。\n千岩万壑看不厌，自谓它山尽糟粕。\n我来因作神仙尉，得舍尘寰少盘礴。\n不因仙客为先容，争得看山这一脚。\n乃知世俗徒扰扰，不若甘心处恬薄。\n长啸拂衣归去来，旧山亦有云泉约。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72517,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨颖士","text":"傥来轩冕何须问，分定功名不在忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72518,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别信州席上作","author":"杨察","text":"十二天辰数，今宵席客盈。\n位如星占野，人若月分卿。\n极醉巫峰倒，联吟嶰琯清。\n他年为舜牧，协力济苍生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72519,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与王伯刍 其一","author":"杨愿","text":"冷官厅事客来稀，种绿阴阴结夏帷。\n忽得君诗惬人意，陶家风到北窗时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72520,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与王伯刍 其二","author":"杨愿","text":"只今侍读周夫子，屡说君诗似杜诗。\n速把冠尘尽弹却，玉堂宵直伴王维。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72521,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"润州","author":"杨模","text":"帆樯共天远，楼观与云平。\n山阅三分国，江横十万兵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72522,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阮郎归","author":"杨端臣","text":"□□今日那人家。\n琐窗红影斜。\n髻云散乱不胜花。\n偷匀残脸霞。\n梁燕老，石榴花。\n佳期今已差。\n凭阑思想入天涯。\n暮云重叠遮。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72523,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔家傲 其二","author":"杨端臣","text":"楼鼓数声人迹散。\n马蹄不响街尘软。\n门户深深扃小院。\n帘不卷。\n背灯尽烛红条短。\n归路恍如春梦断。\n千愁万恨知何限。\n昨夜月华明似练。\n花影畔。\n算来惟有嫦娥见。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72524,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔家傲 其一","author":"杨端臣","text":"有个人人情不久。\n而今已落他人手。\n见说近来伊也瘦。\n好教受。\n看谁似我能撋就。\n莲脸能匀眉黛皱。\n相思泪滴残妆透。\n总是自家为事谬。\n从今后。\n这回断了心先有。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72525,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨粹中","text":"山犹连蜀道，人已作秦音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72526,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"杨韶父","text":"溪水清。\n溪水浑。\n溪上人家数亩园。\n垂杨深闭门。\n青罗裙。\n白罗裙。\n采尽青蘩到白蘋。\n江南三月春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72527,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伊州三台令/伊州三台","author":"杨韶父","text":"水村月淡云低。\n为爱寒香晚吹。\n瘦马立多时。\n是谁家、茅舍竹篱。\n三三两两芳蕤。\n未放琼铺雪堆。\n只这一些儿。\n胜东风、千枝万枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72528,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"如梦令","author":"杨韶父","text":"凉月薄阴犹殢。\n红豆一枝秋思。\n门外几重山，山外行人千里。\n归未。\n归未。\n又是菊花天气。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72529,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题徐氏金湖书院","author":"杨徵","text":"君家仙馆带林塘，气象清新志趣长。\n千里客来如海若，一楼诗静透文光。\n门闾旌表芝兰贵，科第联芳桂籍香。\n帝里词人多景慕，愿题诗句满修篁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72530,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望江南/忆江南","author":"杨慧淑","text":"江北路，一望雪皑皑。\n万里打围鹰隼急，六军刁斗去还来。\n归客别金台。\n江北酒，一饮动千杯。\n客有黄金如粪土，薄情不肯赎奴回。\n挥泪洒黄埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72531,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题钓台","author":"杨潜","text":"遐想当年隐富春，生涯只寄一丝纶。\n幸逢白水为真主，肯向青山访故人。\n试问勒功依日月，何如占象动星辰。\n回头四七皆尘迹，独有先生迹未尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72532,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏东山广福院","author":"杨璇","text":"舣棹青山下，来寻蓟子家。\n人鱼皆静乐，水木亦清华。\n松老欲成盖，菊寒殊未花。\n何须觅句漏，此自有丹砂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72533,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题大洪山","author":"杨逴","text":"随州西南多群峰，争高竞秀无终穷。\n众山迤逦渐行尽，始见独尊惟大洪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72534,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨逴","text":"前年蹭蹬一麾出，乃得凭轼汉水东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72535,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"杨黎州","text":"部中车雨春无润，天上星郎夜损光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72536,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"杨黎州","text":"胡越自为迢递国，参商元是别离星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72537,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"杨黎州","text":"人归汉后黄金屋，燕在卢家白玉堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72538,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"杨黎州","text":"远别苦惊云聚散，相逢多悟月盈亏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72539,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"杨黎州","text":"刚肠欺竹叶，衰鬓怯芦花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72540,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"杨黎州","text":"天上羲轮都易识，人间尧历自难逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72541,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"杨黎州","text":"一斑早寄湘川竹，万点空遗岘首碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72542,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"杨黎州","text":"山川百蛮国，雨露九天书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72543,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"杨黎州","text":"若非琥珀休为枕，不是琉璃莫作屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72544,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小楼连苑/水龙吟 梅","author":"杨樵云","text":"一枝斜堕墙腰，向人颤袅如相媚。\n是谁剪取，断云零玉，轻轻妆缀。\n不是幽人，如何能到，水边沙际。\n又匆匆过了，春风半面，尽长把、重门闭。\n只管相思成梦，道无情、又关乡意。\n苍苔半亩，如今已是，鹿胎田地。\n甚欲追陪，却嫌花下，翠环解语。\n待何时月转，幽房醉了，不教归去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72545,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水龙吟 梦","author":"杨樵云","text":"多情不在分明，绣窗日日花阴午。\n依依云絮，溶溶香雪，觑他寻路。\n一滴东风，怎生消得，翠苞红栩。\n被疏钟敲断，流莺唤起，但长记、弓弯舞。\n定是相思入骨，到如今、月痕同醉。\n教人枉了，若还真个，匆匆如此。\n全未惺松，缬纹生眼，胡床犹据。\n算从前、总是无凭，待说与、如何寄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72546,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳 影","author":"杨樵云","text":"只道空烟，又疑流水，依依却是行云。\n了然相对，又是梦纷纭。\n半面春风图画，黄金在、难铸昭君。\n溪桥断，梅花晴雪，端的白三分。\n真真。\n难唤醒，三年抽藕，织得榴裙。\n甚徘徊窥镜，交翼鸾文。\n一片飞花来去，并刀快、剪取晴纹。\n无情处，分明著眼，强半带春醺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72547,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题方干旧隐","author":"杨翱","text":"云山旦暮奇，筑隐世希续。\n脱略浮官心，蝉联先祖躅。\n门横严子濑，壁纪桐君箓。\n应笑泛轻舠，日为官牒束。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72548,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉州作","author":"杨徽之","text":"俗遇腊辰持药献，吏逢衙日隔花参。\n耆宿因来问封部，竹篱西畔是云南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72549,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"翠光亭","author":"杨徽之","text":"钓舟浮浅濑，冈舍晚重林。\n云放千峰出，花藏一径深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72550,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉阳晚泊","author":"杨徽之","text":"傍桥吟望汉阳城，山遍楼台彻上层。\n犬吠竹篱沽酒客，鹤随苔岸洗衣僧。\n疏钟未彻闻寒漏，斜月初沈见远灯。\n夜静邻船问行计，晓帆相与向巴陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72551,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送梦英大师","author":"杨徽之","text":"独携瓶锡欲春残，深入终南路屈盘。\n万象幽玄吟里见，一心圆寂定中观。\n翠微寺在杉松老，紫阁峰高水石寒。\n莫凭危栏临北望，满城烟草是长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72552,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食寄郑起侍郎","author":"杨徽之","text":"清明时节出郊原，寂寂山城柳映门。\n水隔淡烟脩竹寺，路经疏雨落花村。\n天寒酒薄难成醉，地迥楼高易断魂。\n回首故山千里外，别离心绪向谁言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72553,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"禁林宴会之什","author":"杨徽之","text":"星移岁律应青阳，得奉群英集玉堂。\n龙凤双飞观御札，云霞五色咏天章。\n禁林渐觉清风暖，仙界元知白日长。\n诏出紫泥封去润，朝回莲烛赐来香。\n二篇称奖恩尤重，万国传闻道更光。\n何幸微才逢盛事，愿因史册纪馀芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72554,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"峨眉","author":"杨徽之","text":"嘉州山水地，二蜀最为美。\n翠岭叠峨眉，长澜涌锦水。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72555,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"杨徽之","text":"青帝已教春不老，素娥何惜月长圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72556,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"杨徽之","text":"戍楼烟自直，战地雨长腥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72557,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"杨徽之","text":"杳杳烟芜何处尽，摇摇风柳不胜垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72558,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"杨徽之","text":"春归万年树，月满九重城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72559,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"杨徽之","text":"新霜染枫叶，皓月借芦花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72560,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨徽之","text":"少孤主易感。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72561,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"杨徽之","text":"开尽菊花秋色老，落残桐叶雨声寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72562,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"杨徽之","text":"浮花水入瞿塘峡，带雨云归越巂州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72563,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"杨徽之","text":"偶题岩石云生笔，闲绕庭松露湿衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72564,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"杨徽之","text":"少年牢落今何幸，叨遇君王问姓名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72565,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九师堂","author":"杨蟠","text":"易道已南矣，清风今尚寒。\n山人空再拜，不识汉衣冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72566,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巾子峰","author":"杨蟠","text":"首出群山内，晴窗几处看。\n不因风雨折，开槛满溪寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72567,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"飞来峰","author":"杨蟠","text":"飞来天竺远，山秀已含春。\n不遇名僧识，千年岂有神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72568,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五马坊","author":"杨蟠","text":"相传有五马，曾此立踟躇。\n人爱使君好，换鹅非俗书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72569,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长桥","author":"杨蟠","text":"皎皎冰壶里，天寒六月风。\n水仙来往处，三岛忽相通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72570,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东岗古塔","author":"杨蟠","text":"东岗人不识，野寺在樵渔。\n落叶年年满，春风为扫除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72571,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北高峰","author":"杨蟠","text":"杳杳孤峰上，寒阴带远城。\n不知山下雨，奎斗自分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72572,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永嘉双莲桥","author":"杨蟠","text":"昨日采莲者，双双桥畔新。\n旧花今不见，喜见似花人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72573,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉水堂","author":"杨蟠","text":"小池鸥鹭不成群，池畔萧然一史君。\n时霎醉眠春雨足，觉来衣上有閒云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72574,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白云岭","author":"杨蟠","text":"白云出山去，摇曳或西东。\n人住白云下，安然心已空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72575,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白云峰","author":"杨蟠","text":"万顷田间雨，多从顶上生。\n野人犹不足，常拟凿为平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72576,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白沙泉","author":"杨蟠","text":"不见泉来穴，沙平落细声。\n夜高寒月漾，银汉太分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72577,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石桥","author":"杨蟠","text":"突兀临飞鸟，溪僧惯往来。\n云山多乐处，且入小天台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72578,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙泓洞","author":"杨蟠","text":"六月千里旱，偷泉心亦卑。\n不烦山老祝，神物久无思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72579,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伏龙溅","author":"杨蟠","text":"静久波涛散，溪深涌乱丝。\n悠悠山下客，将见水停时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72580,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"华严塔","author":"杨蟠","text":"石下有灵骨，千年生玉芝。\n山神每藏护，不使世人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72581,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"华盖山","author":"杨蟠","text":"七山如北斗，城锁几重重。\n斗口在何处，正当华盖峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72582,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后永嘉百咏 放生池","author":"杨蟠","text":"悠然已更乐，知是鼎中馀。\n有海尚可往，慎毋重见渔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72583,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后永嘉百咏 南塘","author":"杨蟠","text":"出门日已晚，棹短路何长。\n赖有风相送，荷花十里香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72584,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"地炉","author":"杨蟠","text":"天地风霜日夜新，地炉稳坐暖如春。\n筋骸已畅心无用，转愧窗间映雪人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72585,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朱墅","author":"杨蟠","text":"白云今不去，惆怅昔人非。\n叶落风前响，犹疑踏雪归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72586,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]